semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>None</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>None</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">값이 없음 (null)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-yellow-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>bytes</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>b&quot;abc&quot;</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">바이트</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-yellow-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Any</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>from typing import Any</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">타입 검사 제한</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-yellow-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">타입 힌트</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">count: int = 0\r\nname: str = &quot;kim&quot;\r\nratio: float = 0.5\r\nitems: list[str] = []\r\n\r\ncount = &quot;text&quot;     # 실행은 됨 — 힌트는 검사기(mypy)용, TS 처럼 막지 않음\r\n\r\ntype UserId = str | int          # 타입 별칭 (Python 3.12+), 이전: UserId = str | int</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">변수 선언 키워드(let/const)가 없다. 상수는 관례상 대문자 MAX_SIZE = 100</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 기본 타입</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/python/types/basic-types","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"python","title":"PYTHON","path":"it/syntax/python"},{"id":"types","title":"기본 타입","path":"it/syntax/python/types"}],"hasImage":false}